{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50789","headline":"奉和湖州苏员外题游柸池 · 张祜","name":"奉和湖州苏员外题游柸池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧胜因金刹，新迁就水堂。\n何劳数爵筭，不止一龟航。\n忝座非珎席，穷源喜滥觞。\n酒醲开若醖，诗妙掇苹芳。\n广槛余清景，连山叠霁光。\n徒思继高韵，益叹谬成章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}